# Clamorous Ironclad's menace: crewed on turn 3 by a Hill Giant (power exactly 3), the 6/3 attacks into two Ornithopters (0/2). A single
# Ornithopter may not block it (the refusal), the two together may (the positive control): with 6 damage to assign both Ornithopters
# die and the Ironclad (blocked, so Bot2 takes nothing: 20) lives with 0 damage.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Clamorous Ironclad
Hill Giant
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Island x18

