Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Clamorous Ironclad.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
